    {
      "id": "claim_92fa29b7fb3c477cb97e580376e4ed1c",
      "statement": "Cross-section aggregation applies the anti-fabrication predicate twice — once to filter contributing sections and once to re-validate the aggregated result as a deliberate safety net — and returns not_evaluated with an explicit French justification when no section produced a compliant score.",
