    {
      "id": "claim_465e6763d1da4cc7ba1bd8e1e294c7ee",
      "statement": "The golden Q&A workflow keeps a generated answer only when the model explicitly marked it covered with `oui` and the answer text is non-empty; every other case collapses to the marker \"Non couvert par le document\" with couvert forced to \"non\", and this fallback is applied independently on both the per-document and the retrieval-grounded corpus-wide paths.",
